Ge gar `aly;wc@ ac[ici `emasw@ `nje taiPar;enoc@ e;meh `ntai`o.

Dauid afcaji e;bytc@ je `a P[oic cwtp `nCiwn@ afi afswpi `nqytc@ sa `ntefco] `mmon.

`Ete ;ai te Maria@ `etacini saron@ `n]eleu;eria@ `n`ewni`on.

Za,ariac afjoc@ je ]lu,nia `nnoub@ ;y`etau;amioc@ qen hanjij `nnoub.

Yca`yac afjoc nan@ qen oucmy `n;elyl@ je ecmici nan@ `nEmmanouyl.

:ai te Ieroucalym@ ]polic `mPennou]@ ]`arety `nni,eroubim@ etoi `nou`;ronoc `mV].

