KurioC pirefnohem@ afse `eqoun saroc@ ac`ohi ecsotem@ `mpesry] kalwc.

Laoc niben cehwc@ nem niacpi `nlac@ `e]Qe`otokoc@ `:mau `mMaciac.

Maria ]cemne@ `pounof `nnidikeoc@ ouoh `n`aly;iny@ `vrasI `nnipictoc.

Nem ]te,ny@ `eta Mw`ucyc ;amioc@ qen ounis] `ntai`o@ ouoh `ntka;aroc.

Xulon enneswc@ `nlibanoc `nte pilogicmoc@ `nte pimai,riCtoc.

Ounis] pe `p`wou@ `nte tepar;enia@ `w ;y`e;meh `n`wou@ ]`agia Maria.

PiCtamnoC ettaiyout@ ouoh ]lu,nia@ ]soury ettoubayout@ e;meh `neulogia.

Ran niben et[oci@ `nte ni`acwmatoc@ `mpousvoh `ep[ici@ `nte nemakaricmoc.

Ceten;wn] `episbwt@ `nte A`arwn@ `etafviri `ebol afrwt@ ouoh af]karpon.

Te[oci `emasw@ `ehote Ni,eroubim@ tetaiyout `nhou`o@ `eNiceravim.

Uioc :eoc Pennou]@ `aremici `mmof@ ten]`wou naf hwc Nou]@ ouoh tenouwst `mmof.

