Glory to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Spirit.
The slaughtered One was seen. The slaughtered one is present among you. The slaughtered One is crucified on the Cross.
Now and ever and unto the ages of the ages. Amen.
This is perceptible. This is miraculous. Worship is due to the only-begotten Christ.
The blessings of the Holy Trinity (2): the Father and the Son, and the Holy Spirit.
The blessings of the Theotokos (2): Mary the Mother of Jesus Christ.
The blessings of our Patriarch (2): the honorable father, the archpriest Pope Abba Tawadros.
The blessing of our Metropolitan (2), the honorable father Abba (...).
The blessing of our Bishop (2), the honorable father Abba (...).
Shall come upon this entire congregation. Amen. So be it.
The Catholic Epistle. The Catholic Epistle. The Catholic Epistle.','Apetjyk `ebol@  `nje pi`cmou tou logou pefiwt `i af[icarx hwc rwmi `ntelioc.
