pticFont">qe</span><span class="HazzatFont">x </span><span class="CopticFont">n &nbsp;`</span><span class="HazzatFont">x </span><span class="CopticFont">;nou</span><span class="HazzatFont">x </span><span class="CopticFont">ni</span><span class="HazzatFont">x </span><span class="CopticFont">&nbsp;`</span><span class="HazzatFont">x </span><span class="CopticFont">nIe</span><span class="HazzatFont">x </span><span class="CopticFont">cce</span><span class="HazzatFont">zz</span><span class="CopticFont">.</span>',NULL,1791566503410,1791566503410,'Hail to you Mary:  the beautiful dove:  who gave birth to:  God the Word.
You are the flower:  of incense:  that has blossomed:  from the root of Jesse.
The rod of Aaron:  which blossomed:  without planting or watering:  resembles you.
O who gave birth to Christ:  our True God:  without the seed of man:  and remained a virgin.
Wherefore everyone:  magnifies you:  O my Lady the Mother of God:  the Ever-Holy.
And we too, hope to win mercy:  through your intercession:  with the Lover of mankind.','<ere ne Mari`a@  ][rompi e;necwc@  ;y`etacmici nan@  `mV] pilogoc.
